# LeakSanitizer suppressions for `make SANITIZE=1 test`: leaks inside Qt,
# never in BeerSSH's own code. Each entry names the frame and why.
#
# QScroller::grabGesture registers a QFlickGestureRecognizer per scroller;
# QScroller's destructor unregisters it and leaves deleting it to the
# gesture manager, which never does. 16 bytes a host editor, measured
# 2026-11-20 (Qt 6.8.2); it turned a child process's exit code to 1 and
# failed handoff_test with nothing of ours wrong.
leak:QScroller::grabGesture
